            <fields>
                <name>Confirm_Screen_Section1_Column1</name>
                <fieldType>Region</fieldType>
                <fields>
                    <name>ConfirmationMessage1</name>
                    <fieldText>&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;New account creation is restricted through&amp;nbsp;Admin&amp;nbsp;registration. You can either reuse an account from the previous page or initiate new account request.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;Please select &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;YES&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt; if you would like to proceed with a request to create a new account, else select &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;NO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</fieldText>
                    <fieldType>DisplayText</fieldType>
                    <styleProperties>
                        <verticalAlignment>
